          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi olwa ing'ombe yiba niyifumira omundu omusaatsa kata omukhasi nolwika, nafwa, ing'ombe eyo okhuula yilaswe namachina, inyama yayo niyiraliibwa ta; ne omwene ng'ombe eyo abula eshiina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa ing'ombe eyo niyiba niyalinji niyifumiranga abandu netsinzika khale, omweneyo naye niyeekaanwa, narachiboha ta, mana niyiira omundu omusaatsa kata omukhasi; kho ing'ombe yilaswe namachina, khandi omweneyo naye yeerwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naba nareebwakhwo eshinunulo, kho ahaane eshieneshio eshiareebwa khuye shibe eshinunula obulamubwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata niyifumira omwana womundu, omusiani kata omukhaana, akholelwe obukhalachi buno shinga olwa buli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ing'ombe eyo niyiba niyifumira omukholi omusaatsa kata oweshikhasi, kho aheelesie omwami wabwe ifeetsa eyichelwa tsishekeli amakhumi kataru, ne ing'ombe yilaswe namachina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
