              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi olwa ing'ombe yomundu yiba niyifumira eyoundi, kho bakusie ing'ombe eyo inamu nibakabana obuhlsi bvvayo; khandi eyifwile nayo, bachikabane. ",
