          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nikaba nikamanyikha mbu ing'ombe eyo yalinji niyifumiranga khale, omweneyo naye narachibohanga ta; okhuula arunje ing'ombe khung'ombe; evifwile nayo yibe eyiye.",
